    "Create a free API consumer at opensubtitles.com › Profile › API consumers and paste its key here. Signing in is optional and raises the daily limit. Keys stay in your Keychain.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erstelle unter opensubtitles.com › Profile › API consumers einen kostenlosen API-Consumer und füge seinen Schlüssel hier ein. Die Anmeldung ist optional und erhöht das Tageslimit. Schlüssel bleiben in deinem Schlüsselbund."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crea un consumidor de API gratuito en opensubtitles.com › Profile › API consumers y pega aquí su clave. Iniciar sesión es opcional y aumenta el límite diario. Las claves se guardan en tu llavero."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Créez un consommateur d’API gratuit sur opensubtitles.com › Profile › API consumers et collez sa clé ici. La connexion est facultative et relève la limite quotidienne. Les clés restent dans votre Trousseau."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crea un consumer API gratuito su opensubtitles.com › Profile › API consumers e incolla qui la sua chiave. L’accesso è facoltativo e alza il limite giornaliero. Le chiavi restano nel tuo Portachiavi."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "opensubtitles.com › プロフィール › API consumersで無料のAPIコンシューマを作成し、そのキーをここに貼り付けてください。サインインは任意で、1日の上限が引き上げられます。キーはキーチェーンに保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "opensubtitles.com › Profile › API consumers에서 무료 API consumer를 만들고 키를 여기에 붙여넣으세요. 로그인은 선택 사항이며 일일 한도를 높여 줍니다. 키는 키체인에 보관됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crie um consumidor de API gratuito em opensubtitles.com › Profile › API consumers e cole a chave aqui. Entrar é opcional e aumenta o limite diário. As chaves ficam nas suas Chaves."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 opensubtitles.com›Profile›API consumers 创建免费的 API consumer，并在此粘贴其密钥。登录为可选，可提高每日限额。密钥保存在你的钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
